# .harness/schedule.registry — human-approved OS timers, one extended regex per line.
# sched_audit.sh fails on any live cron / launchd agent / at job / user timer that
# matches nothing here. Agents may PROPOSE lines; only the founder commits them.
# An empty registry means: no third-party timers are approved on this substrate.
#
# Workstation baseline [PROPOSED by agent 2026-08-09 — UNRATIFIED until the founder
# commits this file]: user-level launchd agents that ship with tools already in use
# on this machine. Narrow by name, not by wildcard. Delete any line you don't grant.
^com\.docker\.
^com\.microsoft\.
^com\.google\.keystone
^homebrew\.mxcl\.
